{"seq":3,"slug":"the-scale-challenge","title":"规模带来的挑战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/monorepo-and-agents/the-scale-challenge","wordCount":1723,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"规模带来的挑战\">规模带来的挑战</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-规模的四根坐标轴\">核心概念：规模的四根坐标轴</h2><p>&quot;大仓库难伺候&quot;不是一句感受，而是四个可以分别测量、分别降解的维度：<strong>记忆轴</strong>——文件与包的总量超出任何模型上下文窗口，且长上下文中部的信息召回天然偏弱（arXiv:<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.03172\">2307.03172</a>）；<strong>磁盘轴</strong>——依赖安装与重复存储随包数增长；<strong>时间轴</strong>——全量构建测试的耗时随任务数线性甚至超线性上涨；<strong>波及轴</strong>——共享包的下游数量决定一次改动的最大影响半径。四个轴的量纲不同，解法也不同，但共同思路只有一个：把 agent 需要面对的集合从&quot;整个仓库&quot;缩到&quot;当下相关的那一小块&quot;。下文逐轴给出已验证的降解手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"磁盘轴-依赖图的物理成本\">磁盘轴：依赖图的物理成本</h2><p>pnpm 的第一项设计就是针对规模：全局内容寻址存储（content-addressable store）保存每个包的文件，再以硬链接挂进各项目的 <code>node_modules</code>；同一依赖的不同版本只额外存储有差异的文件（<a href=\"https://pnpm.io/motivation\">pnpm.io/motivation</a>）。几十个包共用一份 lodash 时，磁盘上只有一份实体。这是安装时间的第一次压缩。</p>\n<p>第二次压缩在供应链侧。pnpm 10 起，默认不再执行依赖自身的 lifecycle scripts，官方发布说明称之为面向安全的破坏性变更，需要放行的包要列入 <code>onlyBuiltDependencies</code> 白名单（<a href=\"https://github.com/pnpm/pnpm/releases/tag/v10.0.0\">GitHub: pnpm v10.0.0 release</a>）；现行配置进一步演化为 <code>pnpm-workspace.yaml</code> 中的 <code>allowBuilds</code> 设置（<a href=\"https://pnpm.io/settings\">pnpm.io/settings</a>）。本仓库就显式放行了两条：<code>better-sqlite3</code> 与 <code>esbuild</code>——前者是原生模块必须编译，后者安装时会按平台下载二进制。对 agent 的直接启示：在干净检出后构建失败，先查脚本白名单是否齐全，而不是盲目重装。</p>\n<h2 id=\"时间轴-从全量到受影响集\">时间轴：从全量到受影响集</h2><p>设仓库有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个可执行任务的单元，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则全量成本为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>N</mi></munderover><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{full}}=\\sum_{i=1}^{N} t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.106em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8283em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>受影响分析把它换成另一个和：对改动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 计算受影响集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⊆</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A(c)\\subseteq\\{1,\\dots,N\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊆</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>，其中缓存命中的任务只需付取回代价 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>（通常比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 小两个数量级）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>aff</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>h</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{aff}}=\\sum_{i\\in A(c)}\\big[(1-h_i)\\,t_i+h_i\\cdot r\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">aff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.566em;vertical-align:-1.516em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.809em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.516em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>加速比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>full</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>aff</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=T_{\\text{full}}/T_{\\text{aff}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">aff</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 增大而放大——规模越大，增量机制的相对收益越高，这是 monorepo 工具链存在的数学理由。受影响集合具体怎么算见<a href=\"../tasks-and-tooling-at-scale/affected-and-impact-analysis\">受影响范围分析</a>，缓存命中项的哈希机制见<a href=\"../tasks-and-tooling-at-scale/task-running-and-caching\">任务运行与缓存</a>。</p>\n<p>机制上各家已收敛到同一套三步：先从 git 求变更集，再沿项目图传播出受影响项目，最后只执行这些项目上的任务。Nx 官方描述其 affected 命令即如此工作：&quot;use Git to determine the files you changed in your PR&quot;，并建议与远程缓存、分布式任务执行搭配使用（<a href=\"https://nx.dev/concepts/affected\">nx.dev/concepts/affected</a>）。Turborepo 提供等价的 <code>turbo run build --affected</code> 与 git 区间过滤 <code>[main...HEAD]</code>，其 run 参考文档同时提醒：浅克隆会破坏 affected 判定，需以 <code>--filter=blob:none --depth=0</code> 方式克隆保证历史正确（<a href=\"https://turborepo.com/docs/reference/run\">turborepo.com/docs/reference/run</a>）。缓存产物本身可以跨机器复用——Turborepo 远程缓存的官方一句话定义是 &quot;Share cache artifacts across machines for even faster builds&quot;（<a href=\"https://turborepo.com/docs/core-concepts/remote-caching\">turborepo.com/docs/core-concepts/remote-caching</a>）；Nx 则把缓存键建立在任务输入哈希上，本地与远程共用一套逻辑（<a href=\"https://nx.dev/concepts/how-caching-works\">nx.dev/concepts/how-caching-works</a>）。一条 PR 在这套流水线里的完整路径：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  P[&quot;PR 推送&quot;] --&gt; D[&quot;git diff 对比基线&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; G[&quot;读取项目依赖图&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; A[&quot;计算受影响任务集合&quot;]&#10;  A --&gt; H{&quot;逐任务查缓存&quot;}&#10;  H -- 命中 --&gt; R[&quot;取回远程产物&quot;]&#10;  H -- 未命中 --&gt; E[&quot;本地执行任务&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; U[&quot;上传产物进远程缓存&quot;]&#10;  R --&gt; S[&quot;汇总门禁结果&quot;]&#10;  U --&gt; S\">flowchart TD\n  P[\"PR 推送\"] --&gt; D[\"git diff 对比基线\"]\n  D --&gt; G[\"读取项目依赖图\"]\n  G --&gt; A[\"计算受影响任务集合\"]\n  A --&gt; H{\"逐任务查缓存\"}\n  H -- 命中 --&gt; R[\"取回远程产物\"]\n  H -- 未命中 --&gt; E[\"本地执行任务\"]\n  E --&gt; U[\"上传产物进远程缓存\"]\n  R --&gt; S[\"汇总门禁结果\"]\n  U --&gt; S</pre><h2 id=\"检出与交付轴-让仓库大小和工作集脱钩\">检出与交付轴：让仓库大小和工作集脱钩</h2><p>第三个可裁剪的对象是检出本身。Git 的 sparse-checkout 允许只检当前工作涉及的子树，且 cone 模式已是现行默认，按目录递归圈定而无需手写通配符（<a href=\"https://git-scm.com/docs/git-sparse-checkout\">git-scm.com/docs/git-sparse-checkout</a>）；配合 partial clone 的 <code>--filter=blob:none</code>，克隆时只取树对象不取文件内容，访问时才按需下载——上一节 Turborepo 对 CI 克隆的建议正是这一机制。容器化交付场景还有第三把刀：<code>turbo prune</code> 从依赖图剪出一个只含目标应用及其依赖的子工作区，供 Docker 单独构建镜像（<a href=\"https://turborepo.com/docs/reference/prune\">turborepo.com/docs/reference/prune</a>）。三者指向同一原则：<strong>物理检出的大小不必等于逻辑仓库的大小</strong>，agent 的工作环境应始终是裁剪后的子集——同一原则落到任务与上下文层，就是<a href=\"../working-in-a-monorepo-with-agents/scoping-agent-work-to-packages\">把 Agent 的工作圈定到包</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复利的两面\">复利的两面</h2><p>规模带来方向相反的两种复利。坏的一种来自无约束耦合：每引入一个包都可能新增跨包依赖边，图变稠密后受影响集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|A(c)|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 趋向 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span>，增量机制名存实亡——这正是<a href=\"package-boundaries-as-the-map\">包边界作为 Agent 的地图</a>强调边界 lint 的量化理由。好的一种来自缓存：团队与 agent 会话反复触碰相近的任务子集时，命中率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 上升，连续 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 轮全命中的累计节省为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>full</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo>−</mo><msubsup><mi>T</mi><mtext>aff</mtext><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{j=1}^{k}\\big(T^{(j)}_{\\text{full}}-T^{(j)}_{\\text{aff}}\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4806em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">full</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.3948em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.0448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3987em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">aff</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2198em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3013em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span>，随轮次线性累积。工程努力的目标就是把系统从坏复利曲线挪到好复利曲线上：边界越干净，好复利越容易兑现。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>典型症状</th>\n<th>降解机制</th>\n<th>依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>记忆</td>\n<td>装不下、中部失焦</td>\n<td>检索 + 分层指令 + 稀疏检出</td>\n<td>arXiv:2307.03172, git-scm</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>磁盘</td>\n<td>安装慢、体积爆炸</td>\n<td>内容寻址存储 + 硬链接</td>\n<td>pnpm.io/motivation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>供应链</td>\n<td>postinstall 注入风险</td>\n<td>默认禁脚本 + 白名单</td>\n<td>pnpm v10 发布说明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算</td>\n<td>全量验证分钟级</td>\n<td>受影响分析 + 远程缓存</td>\n<td>nx.dev, turborepo.com</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>波及</td>\n<td>改共享包漏改下游</td>\n<td>项目图传播 + changeset 半径控制</td>\n<td>changesets.dev</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>CI 克隆配方固化成模板</strong>：<code>--filter=blob:none</code> 保历史正确性、合理的 fetch depth 控制时长，两者写进流水线脚手架，避免每条 PR 各自踩坑。</li>\n<li><strong>把缓存命中率当一等指标看</strong>：命中率异常下跌时先检查任务输入哈希里是否混进了不稳定字段——时间戳、绝对路径、未锁定的工具版本都会让哈希永远不同。</li>\n<li><strong>postinstall 白名单走评审</strong>：新增带构建脚本的依赖时在 <code>allowBuilds</code> 中显式登记并说明理由，配合 pnpm 的 <code>strictDepBuilds</code> 类设置兜底，防止白名单无声膨胀。</li>\n<li><strong>给 agent 下达规模预算</strong>：任务提示中明确&quot;只在以下子树内检索与修改&quot;，与 sparse-checkout 的锥形范围保持一致，从源头防止它把注意力摊满整个仓库。</li>\n<li><strong>发版半径用 changesets 控制</strong>：跨包改动要求逐包写 changeset 并声明 bump 类型，CI 校验&quot;动了 <code>exports</code> 却只有 patch&quot;这类不一致。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>规模的四根轴各有对应杠杆：记忆靠裁剪与分层指令，磁盘靠存储去重，时间靠受影响分析与远程缓存，波及半径靠边界与版本纪律。所有杠杆共享同一个目标——让 agent 在百包仓库里的每次操作，成本接近一个十包小仓库。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"规模带来的挑战","id":"规模带来的挑战"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：规模的四根坐标轴","id":"核心概念-规模的四根坐标轴"},{"level":2,"text":"磁盘轴：依赖图的物理成本","id":"磁盘轴-依赖图的物理成本"},{"level":2,"text":"时间轴：从全量到受影响集","id":"时间轴-从全量到受影响集"},{"level":2,"text":"检出与交付轴：让仓库大小和工作集脱钩","id":"检出与交付轴-让仓库大小和工作集脱钩"},{"level":2,"text":"复利的两面","id":"复利的两面"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"包边界作为 Agent 的地图","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/monorepo-and-agents/package-boundaries-as-the-map"},"next":{"title":"Workspace 与包布局","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-monorepo/structuring-a-monorepo-for-agents/workspaces-and-package-layout"}}